Hi!

I hope you are well!
I would like to create a matrix as a derived quantity from my model.
For example:

SparseMatrix<Type> L = B^-1/2*K*B^-1/2;

where both matrices come from R (B = DATA_MATRIX and K = DATA_SPARSE_MATRIX). However, I don't know how to create B^-1/2 (B is a rectangular matrix).

I tried to do the following:
matrix<Type> B2 = pow(B, -1/2);

but it did not work.
I someone can help me I would be grateful.
Thanks!

